OL,3,GNEWSAMercury Prize ceremony under way
OL,4,Awith Olivia Dean, Raye and Dave among
OL,5,Athose shortlisted
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Mercury Prize is under way in
OL,8,FNewcastle with 12 artists waiting to
OL,9,Fsee if they have won the prestigious
OL,10,Faward
OL,12,FThe prize honours the best overall
OL,13,Falbum from the UK or Ireland, with the
OL,14,Fwinner being chosen by a panel of music
OL,15,Fexperts
OL,17,FOlivia Dean, Florence + the Machine,
OL,18,FRaye, and Dave are among the favourites
OL,19,Fon tonight's shortlist
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
