OL,3,GNEWSAMercury Prize ceremony under way
OL,4,Awith Olivia Dean, Raye and Dave among
OL,5,Athose shortlisted
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn the red carpet, Olivia Dean tells
OL,8,Fthe BBC she feels "I'm still in this
OL,9,Fcrazy whirlwind of it all" after her
OL,10,Frecent success, while Kojey Radical
OL,11,Fsays being involved tonight "means
OL,12,Feverything to me"
OL,14,FThe ceremony is being hosted in
OL,15,FNewcastle for the second time - it was
OL,16,Ffirst held in the city last year, when
OL,17,Fthe #25,000 prize was won by Geordie
OL,18,Ffavourite Sam Fender
OL,20,FYou can listen to a special Mercury
OL,21,FPrize show on Radio 6 Music at the top
OL,22,Fof this page
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
